# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. Abort skips the hosting gate, so a peer reverts
# and garbage collects on a tree this cluster keeps local.
MODULE: PeerRestoreAbortSkipsHostingGate
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an abort compensates a tree this cluster does not replicate under peer authority
PERTURBS: Abort

--- FIND
       /\ fence' = "off"
       /\ IF ~Hosted(t)
--- REPLACE
       /\ fence' = "off"
       /\ IF FALSE
--- END
